oneel</li></ol></nav><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 bg-purple-500/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-4 h-4"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg> Horeca personeel</span><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Goed horecapersoneel <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-pink-400">maakt het verschil</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-purple-100/70 max-w-3xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">Van kleinschalige diners tot grootschalige evenementen. EXTRA levert het hospitality talent dat uw merk versterkt en uw gasten een onvergetelijke ervaring biedt.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/horeca-personeel-inhuren" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-purple-600/20 hover:scale-105">Mogelijkheden bekijken <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 transition-all">Neem contact op</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="max-w-3xl mb-16"><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">In de hospitality industrie draait alles om mensen. Kwalitatief <strong class="text-white/80">horeca personeel</strong> is de belangrijkste schakel tussen uw product en de beleving van uw gast. Bij EXTRA leveren we niet zomaar medewerkers; we leveren gastheren en gastvrouwen die passie hebben voor het vak.</p></div><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-10" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Waarom goed horeca personeel het verschil maakt</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-7 h-7 text-purple-400"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Teamspirit</h3><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Onze mensen zijn gewend om snel in een nieuw team te integreren.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-7 h-7 text-purple-400"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Gastvrijheid</h3><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Getraind op etiquette en oog voor de behoefte van de gast.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:bg-purple-500/30 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-purple-400"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Betrouwbaarheid</h3><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Gemotiveerd door ons unieke beloningssysteem en coaching.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="relative h-16 overflow-hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 64L720 0L1440 64H0Z" fill="#0d0415"></path></svg></div><section class="py-24 bg-[#0a0310]"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Meer dan alleen Amsterdam</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-10">Hoewel onze wortels diep in de Amsterdamse grond zitten, reikt onze expertise verder. We ondersteunen horecaondernemers en eventorganisatoren door heel Nederland die op zoek zijn naar de Amsterdamse flair en professionaliteit.</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Training en Kwaliteitsbewaking</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-8">Kwaliteit is bij ons geen toevalstreffer. Via de EXTRA Academy zorgen we dat onze medewerkers up-to-date blijven met de laatste trends en technieken in de horeca.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Serveertechnieken</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Van plateau-lopen tot uitserveren van meergangen diners.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Barvaardigheden</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Basiskennis van dranken, tappen en snelle service.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Communicatie</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Omgaan met lastige situaties en internationale gasten.</p></div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors"><h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Hygiëne (HACCP)</h4><p class="text-sm text-white/50">Veilig werken met voeding en dranken.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-[#0d0415]"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 " style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6" style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Samenwerken met EXTRA</h2><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">Of u nu op zoek bent naar eenmalige ondersteuning voor een event of een structurele partner voor uw personeelsplanning; wij denken graag met u mee. Hoe beter we uw onderneming kennen, hoe beter we de juiste mensen kunnen selecteren.</p><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Bent u specifiek op zoek naar ondersteuning in de hoofdstad? Kijk dan op onze pagina over <a href="/horeca-personeel-amsterdam" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline underline-offset-2">horeca personeel in Amsterdam</a>. Voor een breder overzicht van onze diensten kunt u terecht op de pagina over ons <a href="/horeca-uitzendbureau-amsterdam" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline underline-offset-2">horeca uitzendbureau</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-violet-700 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute" style="left: 5%; top: 10%; width: 200px; height: 200px; transform: rotate(15deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div><div class="absolute" style="left: 80%; top: 20%; width: 160px; height: 160px; transform: rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0.08; mask-image: url(&quot;/assets/X_patroon_1771260543289-Db4pmQup.webp&quot;); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></div></div><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 text-center relative z-10"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 tran